The ticket-summary feature after the rework:
const context = {
  learner: pseudonym(user.id),       // "L-7f3e"
  plan: user.plan,
  course: ticket.courseTitle,
  ticket: redact(ticket.body),
};
const prompt = buildSummaryPrompt(context);
await llmLog.insert({ ticketId: ticket.id, prompt });
const summary = await provider.complete(prompt);

Unit test output:
redact("Hi, I'm an.nguyen@example.com, call me on 0912 345 678.")
  -> "Hi, I'm [EMAIL], call me on [PHONE]."

Statement: "With this order of calls, neither the provider nor CodeDev's own llmLog table receives the email address that the learner typed into the ticket."
